BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Zahra Ahooei: Film Screening & Conversation October 1\, 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261001T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261001T200000
UID:zahra-ahooei-film-screening-conversation-october-1-2026@ocadu.ca
DESCRIPTION:Zahra Ahooei screens her award-winning short films at OCAD Uni
 versity\n\nZAHRA AHOOEI: FILM SCREENING & CONVERSATION Join Iranian filmma
 ker Zahra Ahooei \, for a screening and conversation about her award-winni
 ng short films and her current documentary project\, HouseLight. FREE (by 
 Ticket only): ZAHRA AHOOEI OCAD FILM SCREENING TICKETS October 1\, 2026 6:
 30-8:00pm OCAD University\, 100 McCaul Street Auditorium (Room 190) Zahra 
 Ahooei is an Iranian filmmaker\, writer\, and media artist currently based
  in Canada. She has directed several short narrative films\, including Ref
 lex (2024)\, Prestige (2020)\, Sign Out (2017)\, and Extra Time (2015)\, w
 hich have been screened internationally and recognized with various awards
 . Her background also includes years of experience in journalism\, televis
 ion writing\, and content creation for both broadcast and digital platform
 s. Zahra’s upcoming project\, HouseLight \, is a feature-length document
 ary that employs a non-fiction storytelling approach. Rooted in her person
 al experiences\, the film explores themes of loss\, memory\, and immigrati
 on through a distinctly female perspective. In 2024\, Zahra developed this
  project during her participation in the Newcomer Filmmentor program at th
 e Liaison of Independent Filmmakers of Toronto (LIFT) . She is currently a
 n IIE Artist Protection Fund Fellow in residence at OCAD University \, whi
 ch acts as the primary host and creative hub for the development and produ
 ction of her ongoing film project. As part of this fellowship network\, OB
 ORO\, an artist-run centre in Montreal dedicated to the presentation and p
 roduction of visual\, media\, and digital arts will also host Zahra during
  the later stages of the project in collaboration with APF and OCAD Univer
 sity. In November 2025\, while still in development\, HouseLight was selec
 ted to participate in Doc Lab Montreal ’s feature film program\, part of
  Forum RIDM\, the industry platform of the Montreal International Document
 ary Festival (RIDM) \, one of North America’s leading documentary events
  fostering creative exchange\, professional development\, and internationa
 l co-productions. Event Sponsors: OCAD University's Faculty of Arts & Scie
 nce \, HOTDOCS \, IIE Artist Protection Fund Film Trailers: Extra Time \, 
 Sign Out \, Prestige \, Reflex Links to Work: IMDb \, YouTube \, Vimeo \, 
 LinkedIn \, Instagram
LOCATION:Main Building & Rosalie Sharp Centre for Design (MCA) 100 McCaul 
 Street Auditorium (Room 190)
URL:https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/zahra-ahooei-film-screening-conversation-o
 ctober-1-2026-tickets-1999296660130?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:OCAD University
END:VEVENT
